  "description": "Years of production: from 2006\n\nSucceeded by the Roadrat Gen2.\n\nThe first generation Roadrat was where our flat bar road bike began: our mountain bike fit and handling, matched with fast road features, big tyre clearance and disc brakes.\n\nFaster than a mountain bike on the road, more fun and versatile than a traditional road bike, the Roadrat was the perfect 'other' bike: swift and rugged, for commuting, road rides, gravel and adventures. Disc brakes have been in the Roadrat's DNA from the very start: the original 2006 version was one of the first road bikes to feature them.",
